++-# API Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-77 (KB-P3-16)
++-
++-- Auditor: arch-reviewer (Swarm Systems/Backend Architect & API Specialist Gate)
++-- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-77`
++-- Branch: `feat/KANBA-77`
