++-+
++-+## Overview
++-+- **Ticket**: KANBA-77 (`KB-P3-16`: `[Phase 3 / API] Realtime WebSocket (/ws) & SSE (/sse Last-Event-ID) hub with per-event RLS filtering`)
++-+- **Status**: Ready for Merge Queue and Reality-Checker QA Gate
